  message: "Satisfied in PR #4194 (merged; origin/dev 6c183e72f7). Fix: routed all four writer-contract record reads through the existing dict-or-attribute _read helper. BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE (production-path test): test_writer_contract_flags_default_config_fingerprint_on_dict_shaped_runs feeds dict runs exactly as cli.py:7905 accumulates them (run.to_dict()); the sub-pattern-2 violation now FIRES (matched=[] under getattr -> 1 violation under _read) and its record_id surfaces the offending run execution_id. Red on getattr, green on _read; test_is_truthy_reads_dict_shaped_record covers the analogue. spec_validator.py at 100% coverage (286 stmts, 0 miss), 2550 passed."  # 663f
